      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jagarciao/{size}/2010_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-08-18T16:04:08.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Ronway\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/48/1856_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ronway:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>But jagarciao would no longer be the only non-playtester with a badge. Wouldn't that be sad?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>VERY sad!!! For the past few months I have finally felt like I AM somebody special… I can finally look at myself in the mirror with pride.</p>\n<p>Please don't… dont take that from me…</p>\n<p><em>tear</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Actually, I think it's a great idea since often times when rules questions come up people want just want to hear an \"official\" answer.&nbsp;</p>",
